              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The petitioners argue that the burden of proof should be placed on the local school system, reflecting Congress\u2019s intent to protect children with disabilities."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Hurd",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "706ba4f37f269665c9e74acf6da06678d4465f5d2ef4d17c9c78216a8a880266",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-706ba4f37f26-0001-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 19,
                "start": 19
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Hurd, they request that the school district bear the burden of persuasion in the hearing."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "706ba4f37f269665c9e74acf6da06678d4465f5d2ef4d17c9c78216a8a880266",
