              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 53,
                "start": 53
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, most jurisdictions, according to the petitioners, place the burden on schools as interpreted by federal courts."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioners (Brian Schaffer, by his parents)",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
